e checkbook which  as he's already suggested he will  continue to use to help offset the  impact of inflation  he's wasting no time Monday the  government announced it was bringing  forward a welfare payment due at the end  of the month and a second one five days  before the runoff  Lucia Newman Al Jazeera Sao Paulo
 

